    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-size: 12px; color: #888;">
        <p>Best Regards,</p>
        <p><strong>Piyush Goyal</strong><br>Director<br>Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Imran Khan</strong>,<br>+91-88825-91733<br>Accounts Leader,<br>Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.</p>
